passed to a copy parameter:
  acquire l
  move l
  use l
  release l
  end of scope
guard passed to a copy parameter:
  acquire guard_l
  copy guard_l'
  use guard_l'
  release guard_l'
  end of scope
  release guard_l
initializes another object:
  acquire l
  move l
  end of inner scope
  release l
  end of scope
guard initializes another object:
  acquire guard_l
  copy guard_l'
  end of inner scope
  release guard_l'
  end of scope
  release guard_l
